# Send every request on the old Level33 domain to quvivant.com.
# The path and any query string (for example ?token=...) carry over to the new address.
# The trailing ! forces the redirect even though the old domain also serves this site.
https://level33businessmastermind.com/* https://quvivant.com/:splat 301!
http://level33businessmastermind.com/* https://quvivant.com/:splat 301!
https://www.level33businessmastermind.com/* https://quvivant.com/:splat 301!
